WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:06.167
Recovered tape dated November fourth, nineteen eighty-seven.

00:06.167 --> 00:11.457
No Department existed on this date, yet the seal is authentic.

00:11.457 --> 00:15.305
The speaker repeats one location beneath the static.

00:15.305 --> 00:19.634
Reverse the instruction only if you intend to continue.

00:19.634 --> 00:23.001
The answer is not a room number.

00:23.001 --> 00:26.849
It is the name of the missing floor.
